! Products Widget Plugin

Display products in elegant card grids with glass-fog styling.

!! Usage

Create product tiddlers with the `Product` tag and these fields:

* `image` - Product image URL
* `description` - Short description
* `fulldescription` - Full description (optional)
* `price` - Price string
* `category` - Category (Education, Consulting, Tools, Research Artifacts)
* `link` - Product link
* `cta` - Call-to-action text (default: "Learn More")

!! Widget Syntax

Display all products:

```
<$product-grid filter="[tag[Product]]" />
```

Display products by category:

```
<$product-grid filter="[tag[Product]category[Education]]" />
```

Individual product card:

```
<$product 
	title="Product Name"
	image="path/to/image.jpg"
	description="Short description"
	price="$99"
	category="Tools"
	link="https://example.com"
	cta="Buy Now"
/>
```


